  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 517009408
    m_Localized: Memory Cards
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 579923968
    m_Localized: 'Match cute critters across three worlds and 18 levels: memorize, beat the clock, dodge bombs, play wild cards, crack ice and follow the parade.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118272
    m_Localized: Classic
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118273
    m_Localized: 'The original look: thirty cute critters, sunny worlds and the rounded Kenney interface.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118274
    m_Localized: After Dark
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118275
    m_Localized: 'A grown-up night out: black, gold and deep red, art deco frames, velvet and lace, and a deck of thirty boudoir and burlesque keepsakes.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118276
    m_Localized: MEMORY CARDS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118277
    m_Localized: A critter matching adventure
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118278
    m_Localized: An after-hours matching game
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118279
    m_Localized: animal
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118280
    m_Localized: animals
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118281
    m_Localized: keepsake
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118282
    m_Localized: keepsakes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118283
    m_Localized: The critters are on the move
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118284
    m_Localized: Sleight of hand - the cards have moved
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118285
    m_Localized: Sunny Farm
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118286
    m_Localized: Meet the barnyard gang!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118287
    m_Localized: Jungle Jam
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118288
    m_Localized: Swing into the wild side!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118289
    m_Localized: Frosty Shores
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118290
    m_Localized: Chill out with icy friends!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118291
    m_Localized: Critter Carnival
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118292
    m_Localized: Every critter, every twist!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118293
    m_Localized: Champagne Bar
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118294
    m_Localized: Every glass, every twist!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118295
    m_Localized: Boudoir
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118296
    m_Localized: Silk, lace and a locked door.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118297
    m_Localized: Velvet Lounge
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118298
    m_Localized: Dim the lights, take a seat.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118299
    m_Localized: Masquerade
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118300
    m_Localized: Nobody knows who you are tonight.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118301
    m_Localized: this world
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118302
    m_Localized: Hello, Farm!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118303
    m_Localized: Flip two cards at a time and find the matching pairs of farm animals.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118304
    m_Localized: Click a card to flip it, then find its twin!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118305
    m_Localized: Barnyard Buddies
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118306
    m_Localized: Find pairs back to back to build a combo worth up to x5 points!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118307
    m_Localized: Combos
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118308
    m_Localized: Matches in a row multiply your points.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118309
    m_Localized: Peek-a-Boo
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118310
    m_Localized: Every card shows its face before the round begins. Remember as many as you can!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118311
    m_Localized: Memorize
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118312
    m_Localized: Watch closely while the cards are face up.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118313
    m_Localized: Race the Rooster
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118314
    m_Localized: Beat the clock before the rooster crows! Every pair you find adds two seconds.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118315
    m_Localized: Time attack
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118316
    m_Localized: The clock is ticking - every match buys you time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118317
    m_Localized: Tick-Tock Barn
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118318
    m_Localized: Clock cards hide among the animals. Flip one for six extra seconds!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118319
    m_Localized: Clock cards
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118320
    m_Localized: Clock cards give you extra time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118321
    m_Localized: Hen Party
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118322
    m_Localized: Five hearts, and every mistake costs one. Can you keep them all?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118323
    m_Localized: Survival
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118324
    m_Localized: Every mistake costs a heart - think before you flip!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118325
    m_Localized: Welcome to the Jungle
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118326
    m_Localized: The rainbow wild card matches any animal - and finds its twin for you!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118327
    m_Localized: Wild card
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118328
    m_Localized: Flip the wild card together with any animal to match all of its kind.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118329
    m_Localized: Monkey Business
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118330
    m_Localized: Cheeky monkeys! After every third mistake the hidden cards swap places.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118331
    m_Localized: Shuffle
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118332
    m_Localized: Three mistakes and the monkeys shuffle the hidden cards!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118333
    m_Localized: Snake Pit
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118334
    m_Localized: Two bombs hide in the pit. Each one costs a heart - remember where they are!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118335
    m_Localized: Bombs
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118336
    m_Localized: Bombs cost a heart. Once you have seen one, stay away from it!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118337
    m_Localized: Parrot Parade
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118338
    m_Localized: The parrots want a parade! Match the animals in the order shown at the top.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118339
    m_Localized: Parade
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118340
    m_Localized: Only the animal the parade asks for counts. Remember the others for later!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118341
    m_Localized: Triple Trouble
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118342
    m_Localized: Everything comes in threes here. Find three of a kind to make a match.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118343
    m_Localized: Triplets
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118344
    m_Localized: Flip three matching cards to make a set.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118345
    m_Localized: Jungle Rumble
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118346
    m_Localized: Bombs, a wild card, a clock and shuffles, all against the clock. Rumble in the jungle!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118347
    m_Localized: Use the wild card on the animal you cannot find.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118348
    m_Localized: Thin Ice
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118349
    m_Localized: Frozen cards need a tap to crack the ice before they will flip.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118350
    m_Localized: Ice
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118351
    m_Localized: Tap a frozen card once to crack the ice, then again to flip it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118352
    m_Localized: Penguin Waddle
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118353
    m_Localized: 'Waddle wisely: you only have 26 moves. Peek cards show the whole board for a moment.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118354
    m_Localized: Moves and peeks
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118355
    m_Localized: Peek cards reveal every hidden card for a moment.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118356
    m_Localized: Whale Songs
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118357
    m_Localized: Triplets against the clock. Sing along and find three of a kind!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118358
    m_Localized: Every set of three adds three seconds.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118359
    m_Localized: Blizzard
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118360
    m_Localized: A blizzard blows the cards around after every second mistake - and some are frozen solid.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118361
    m_Localized: Two mistakes and the blizzard shuffles the hidden cards.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118362
    m_Localized: Polar Parade
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118363
    m_Localized: 'A parade on thin ice: match in order and steer clear of the bombs.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118364
    m_Localized: The parade shows the next animals at the top.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118365
    m_Localized: Aurora Finale
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118366
    m_Localized: The grand finale under the northern lights. Every twist you have learned, all at once!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118367
    m_Localized: Save the peek card for when the board is full of question marks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118368
    m_Localized: Endless Carnival
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118369
    m_Localized: Clear board after board before the clock runs out. Every cleared board adds time, and new twists join the fun.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118370
    m_Localized: Free Play
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118371
    m_Localized: 'Deal a board with your own rules: open Settings to choose the size, the timer, hearts, moves and special cards.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118372
    m_Localized: Doors Open
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118373
    m_Localized: Flip two cards at a time and find the matching pairs. The night is young.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118374
    m_Localized: Bubbly Company
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118375
    m_Localized: A Second Look
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118376
    m_Localized: Beat the Bell
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118377
    m_Localized: Beat the clock before the bell for last orders! Every pair you find adds two seconds.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118378
    m_Localized: After Midnight
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118379
    m_Localized: Clock cards hide among the keepsakes. Flip one for six extra seconds!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118380
    m_Localized: Heartbreakers
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118381
    m_Localized: Wild at Heart
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118382
    m_Localized: The golden wild card matches any keepsake - and finds its twin for you!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118383
    m_Localized: Flip the wild card together with any keepsake to match all of its kind.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118384
    m_Localized: Sleight of Hand
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118385
    m_Localized: Nimble fingers! After every third mistake the hidden cards swap places.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118386
    m_Localized: Three mistakes and the dealer shuffles the hidden cards!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118387
    m_Localized: Silk and Danger
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118388
    m_Localized: Two bombs hide behind the silk. Each one costs a heart - remember where they are!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118389
    m_Localized: Running Order
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118390
    m_Localized: Tonight's parade has a running order! Match the keepsakes in the order shown at the top.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118391
    m_Localized: Only the keepsake the parade asks for counts. Remember the others for later!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118392
    m_Localized: Three's Company
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118393
    m_Localized: Midnight Rumble
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118394
    m_Localized: Bombs, a wild card, a clock and shuffles, all against the clock. The boudoir after midnight!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118395
    m_Localized: Use the wild card on the keepsake you cannot find.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118396
    m_Localized: Cold Shoulder
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118397
    m_Localized: Measured Steps
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118398
    m_Localized: 'Mind your steps: you only have 26 moves. Peek cards show the whole board for a moment.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118399
    m_Localized: The Band Plays On
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118400
    m_Localized: Triplets against the clock. Keep time with the band and find three of a kind!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118401
    m_Localized: Change Partners
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118402
    m_Localized: The dancers change partners after every second mistake - and some cards are frozen solid.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118403
    m_Localized: Two mistakes and the dancers swap the hidden cards.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118404
    m_Localized: Grand Procession
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118405
    m_Localized: 'A procession on thin ice: match in order and steer clear of the bombs.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118406
    m_Localized: The parade shows the next keepsakes at the top.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118407
    m_Localized: Unmasked
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118408
    m_Localized: The grand finale under the chandeliers. Every twist you have learned, all at once!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118409
    m_Localized: Last Call
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
